sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web Interface
    participant Agent as Main ReAct Agent
    participant Sub as Sub-Agents
    participant MCP as MCP Tools
    participant Slurm as Slurm Cluster

    User->>Web: Submit natural language query
    Web->>Agent: Forward query
    
    Note over Agent: THINK PHASE
    Agent->>Agent: Reason about query intent
    
    Note over Agent: ACT PHASE
    Agent->>Sub: Invoke appropriate sub-agent
    Sub->>MCP: Call MCP tools
    MCP->>Slurm: Execute Slurm commands
    Slurm-->>MCP: Return command results
    
    Note over Agent: OBSERVE PHASE
    MCP-->>Sub: Return tool results
    Sub-->>Agent: Process and format results
    
    alt Dangerous Operation
        Agent->>Web: Queue action for confirmation
        Web->>User: Request confirmation
        User->>Web: Confirm or reject
        Web->>Agent: User decision
    end
    
    Agent->>Agent: Generate natural language response
    
    opt Visualization Requested
        Agent->>MCP: Call chart generation tool
        MCP-->>Agent: Return chart data (stored in context)
    end
    
    Agent-)Web: Stream formatted response
    Web-)User: Display results with inline charts
    
    loop Follow-up Queries
        Note over Web,Agent: Context preserved
        User->>Web: Submit follow-up query
        Web->>Agent: Forward with context
    end